thumbor-ai-label

This product bundles icons published by the European Commission as "EU Icons for
labelling AI-generated content" (10 June 2026). They are located under
src/thumbor_ai_label/icons/eu/ and src/thumbor_ai_label/icons/eu-white/, excluding
unknown.png in each directory.

Those icons are not covered by this product's Apache-2.0 licence. The Commission makes
them freely usable without attribution. See THIRD-PARTY.md for provenance and caveats.
